### =============================================================
### API izmēģināšana. Vispirms palaid aplikāciju (BeMacibasApplication).
### IntelliJ: spied ▶ pie katra pieprasījuma.
### VS Code: uzinstalē "REST Client" paplašinājumu.
### Tas pats, ko tu darītu ar fetch() no React!
### =============================================================

### 1. Visas grāmatas (ar lapošanu)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 2. Lapošana + kārtošana: 2. lapa, pa 2, jaunākās vispirms
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?page=1&size=2&sort=publishedYear,desc

### 3. Filtrs pēc autora
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?author=blaum

### 4. Viena grāmata
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 5. Neeksistējoša grāmata → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 6. Autori
GET http://localhost:8080/api/authors

### 7. Izveidot autoru → 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Frank Herbert" }

### 8. Izveidot grāmatu → 201 + Location header (authorId 5 = autors no 7. soļa)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune",
  "isbn": "9780441013593",
  "publishedYear": 1965,
  "authorId": 5
}

### 9. Nederīgi dati → 400 ar kļūdām katram laukam
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "isbn": "abc", "publishedYear": 1200 }

### 10. Atjaunot grāmatu (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Zvejnieka dēls (2. izdevums)",
  "isbn": "9789984000001",
  "publishedYear": 1934,
  "authorId": 1
}

### 11. Aizņemties grāmatu → 201 (skaties konsolē 📧 un 📱 paziņojumus!)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrowerName": "Jānis" }

### 12. Aizņemties to pašu vēlreiz → 409 Conflict
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/1/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{ "borrowerName": "Anna" }

### 13. Jāņa aizņemtās grāmatas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/loans?borrower=Jānis

### 14. Atdot grāmatu
POST http://localhost:8080/api/loans/1/return

### 15. Dzēst grāmatu, kurai nav vēstures → 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/6

### 16. Health check (to lieto load balanceri un Kubernetes)
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
